  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 12.1.4\n\n### Fixes\n- Modifying a displayed document's structure through a `RichTextElementCollection` (`Blocks`, `Inlines`, table rows/cells, list items) now updates the rendering immediately. Adding, inserting, removing, or clearing children of a live `FlowDocument` — including inside nested sections, and text-less blocks such as `BlockUIContainer` — previously changed the document model without notifying the render layer, so the display went stale (old blocks lingered, new blocks were missing) until the document was re-bound.\n- Copying a selection that ends in a trailing empty paragraph — for example via Select-All — now preserves that empty paragraph when the content is pasted. The zero-length trailing paragraph was previously dropped, so copy/paste round-trips silently lost a document's final blank line. Range snapshots are now built by walking the document tree and capturing whole boundary blocks by node identity, rather than re-deriving blocks from start/end offsets, and `ContentEnd`/Select-All now reach a trailing empty block.\n- Numbered (`TextMarkerStyle.Decimal`) list markers now render with the tabular-figures OpenType feature, so the digits line up into a clean column instead of staggering in fonts whose figures have proportional widths. Right-alignment already lined up the periods; this aligns the digits above them. Bullets and roman/latin markers are unaffected, and fonts without tabular figures fall back harmlessly to their default digits.",
